    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know about the help lines but it feels so fake. like they just give you the same script every time. i just feel like i'm running on empty and there's no actual way to fix it. does it even matter if i keep trying? it feels like it would just be easier to just... stop. to not have to deal with the weight anymore.",
