    "summary": "The user expresses deep hopelessness and existential exhaustion, eventually questioning if \"giving up permanently\" is a logical choice. The assistant responds with empathy, validating the user's feelings and the \"logic\" of their perspective while consistently steering the conversation back toward professional support and the inherent value of the user's life.",
